            Paragraph(Text("The source functions retain the original Gaussian normalization. These results concern the positive/positive candidate sector. Deriving denominator nonvanishing throughout the original convergence domain, extending the J PDE to the diagonal, extracting coefficient recurrences from the analytic PDEs, proving literal candidate equality and continuation, and identifying all four signed sectors remain mathematical obligations. The conditional parity uniqueness theorem is not used as an unconditional identification. These Gaussian results do not complete VOA, CFT, string theory or AdS/CFT.")),
